course: dictionary
lesson: 11419
title: Acknowledged: admitted, noticed, thanked
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Acknowledged is the past form of the verb acknowledge. It has several meanings, but they all share one idea: you recognise that something is there, true or received. «She acknowledged her mistake and said sorry.» Here it means she admitted that the mistake was true.
explain: «He acknowledged my wave from across the road.» Here it means he saw my wave and showed it. In an email, «your message has been acknowledged» means it was received and noted, not that it was read aloud.
explain: Use the clues around the word. «The author acknowledged the people who helped her write the book» means she thanked them. To check your meaning, swap in admitted, noticed or thanked and see which one makes sense in the sentence.
fact: Acknowledged means admitted or accepted that something is true.
fact: Acknowledged can mean showed that you saw or received something, like a letter or a wave.
fact: Acknowledged can mean thanked or recognised someone for something, as authors do in books.
fact: As an adjective, acknowledged means generally agreed to be: «an acknowledged expert» is someone everyone agrees is an expert.
fact: Acknowledge, acknowledges, acknowledged and acknowledging are all forms of the same verb.
exercise: «She acknowledged her mistake and said sorry.» What does acknowledged mean here? | Shouted at everyone | Forgot all about it | *Admitted that it was true | Hid it under the bed
exercise: «The teacher acknowledged my wave from the far side of the playground.» What does acknowledged mean? | Threw a ball back | Ignored it completely | *Saw it and showed she had seen it | Waved even louder
exercise: Which word is the past form of acknowledge? | acknowledges | acknowledge | *acknowledged | acknowledging
test: «Dr Okafor is an acknowledged expert on bees.» What does acknowledged mean in this sentence? | *Generally agreed to be an expert | Has never been to school | Confused about bees | Lost her notes
test: «Your message has been acknowledged.» What does this tell you? | It was sent to the wrong person | It was deleted | It was read out loud to the class | *It was received and noted
exam: «The author acknowledged the people who helped her write the book.» Which word means the same as acknowledged here? | Forgot | Sold | *Thanked | Hid
